     ppoomm — display the phase of the moon

SSYYNNOOPPSSIISS
     ppoomm [--pp] [--dd _y_y_y_y_._m_m_._d_d] [--tt _h_h_:_m_m_:_s_s]

DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
     The ppoomm utility displays the current phase of the moon.  Useful for se‐
     lecting software completion target dates and predicting managerial behav‐
     ior.

     Use the --pp option to print just the phase as a percentage.

     Use the arguments --dd and --tt to specify a specific date and time for which
     the phase of the moon has to be calculated.  If --dd but not --tt has been
     specified, it will calculate the phase of the moon on that day at mid‐
     night.

